  "description": "Original By NoonpaphaDigitalArts🍒\nThis Letter to Santa Clipart Set includes 28 hand-drawn Christmas frames and holiday elements. Perfect for DIY crafts, Christmas cards, invitations, stickers, sublimation, scrapbook projects, and festive designs. You’ll find typewriters, envelopes, scrolls, gifts, holly, and more – all in a cozy hand-drawn style.\nUse these high-resolution PNGs for:\n✔ Christmas cards, invitations & stationery\n✔ Bookish planners, journals & stickers\n✔ Holiday mugs, apparel & tote bags\n✔ Scrapbooking & DIY crafts\n✔ Digital projects, social media & blogs\n✔ Blog graphics or social media\n✨ What’s Included:\n✔ 28 individual PNG elements (transparent background)\n-300 DPI resolution (great for print and web)\n-Size: approx. 1000–3000 px each (varies by item)\n✔ 28 SVG files\nInstant digital download – no physical product will be shipped\nAll files are contained in zip folders.\n💌 Please feel free to Contact me for any questions or concerns.\n❤️ All illustrations in this shop are original and created by me. —no AI involved. I made this design with my own hands and a whole lot of heart. So, don’t sweat it if the lines and shapes aren’t absolutely perfect. It’s the imperfections that make it unique!\nThank you for choosing NoonpaphaDigitalArts. Happy creating!",
